    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17184,
        "title": "Condicionais",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145474,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jogos inteligentes usam <strong>booleans</strong> para tomar decisões sobre se devem <em>executar</em> linhas de código ou <em>pular</em> elas.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145475,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como podemos escrever código de jogo que se adapta a diferentes situações? Usando a <strong>instrução if</strong>.</p><p>Nós codificamos a palavra-chave <code>if</code> para uma instrução if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145476,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A instrução if <em>executa o código</em> apenas se o booleano no qual está se baseando for <code>true</code>. É como dizer, <em>se</em> algo for verdadeiro, <em>então</em> faça isso.</p><p><code>\"Player spawned!\"</code> será exibido no console se definirmos o valor booleano como <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145477,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mas e se quisermos <em>pular</em> o código? Usamos <code>false</code> em vez disso.</p><p>Ao definir o valor como <code>false</code>, evitaremos exibir <code>\"Player spawned!\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145478,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Valores como <code>true</code> são chamados de <strong>condições</strong>. Declarações que dependem de condições são chamadas de <strong>condicionais</strong>.</p><p>Condições <em>decidem</em> se o código é executado ou ignorado. Elas vêm entre parênteses.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;condition&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é a palavra-chave para uma instrução if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>if</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>while</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145480,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3 2 1 GO&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3 2 1 GO</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada porque o código entre as chaves é ignorado</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3 2 1 GO</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145481,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy defeated&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nada porque o código entre as chaves é ignorado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Enemy defeated</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nada porque o código entre as chaves é ignorado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145482,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quais são os valores que decidem se um bloco de código é executado ou não?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Condições</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Strings</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Condições.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Monte a instrução if que exibe o console.log.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>if</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>true</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145484,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique <code>true</code> para executar o bloco de código.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145485,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique um valor booleano que pule a instrução de exibição.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Opened inventory&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145486,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Execute a exibição no console.log adicionando <code>(true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"9\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Start game loop&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(true)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17185,
        "title": "Condicionais Verdadeiras e Falsas",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>  As instruções <code>if</code> não decidem pular ou executar o código <em>inteiro</em> do jogo. Elas apenas tomam decisões sobre um <em>pedaço de código</em>.</p><p>Este trecho de código é chamado de <strong>bloco de código</strong>. Nós o escrevemos entre chaves <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player entered the level!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145488,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um bloco de código pode ter mais de uma linha. Podemos adicionar quantas linhas quisermos.</p><p>Use <code>console.log()</code> para adicionar mais uma linha no início.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawning enemy...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>\"Spawning enemy...\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145489,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em vez de usar o booleano <code>true</code>, podemos salvá-lo em uma variável e usá-la como uma condição.</p><p>Crie a variável <code>gameStarted</code> e defina-a como <code>true</code>. Em seguida, use <code>gameStarted</code> como uma condição para a instrução if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameStarted = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameStarted) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>gameStarted</code> seguido de <code>true</code> e finalmente <code>gameStarted</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145490,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usar uma variável definida como <code>false</code> nos permite <em>pular</em> o bloco de código.</p><p>Defina <code>gameStarted</code> como <code>false</code> para evitar imprimir <code>Game start!</code> na saída.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameStarted = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (gameStarted) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145491,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como chamamos o código entre as chaves <code>{}</code> de uma instrução if?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Bloco de código</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Declaração if</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Bloco de código.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145492,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o número máximo de linhas que um bloco de código pode ter?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quantos quisermos</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quantos quisermos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145493,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasKey) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Door unlocked&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Door unlocked</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nada, o código não executa pois <code>hasKey</code> não é um booleano</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Door unlocked</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145494,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que este código exibe no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (isPaused) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nada porque o código entre chaves é ignorado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Game paused</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nada porque o código entre chaves é ignorado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145495,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione a instrução de exibição entre chaves para criar o bloco de código da instrução if.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level complete!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>console.log</code> e depois <code>\"Level complete!\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145496,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione um segundo trecho de código para expandir o bloco de código.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;New quest started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Collect 3 coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>\"Collect 3 coins\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145497,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Faça o bloco de código rodar atribuindo um valor à variável.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canRespawn = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (canRespawn) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Respawning player...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145498,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pule a instrução de exibição definindo <code>hasEnoughCoins</code> como <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasEnoughCoins = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (hasEnoughCoins) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Item purchased&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
